 "title": "Home - Kanza Coop",
 "text": "Home - Kanza Coop\nMain\nUtilities\nAbout\nWhat is a Coop?\nNews\nBoard of Directors\nEmployee Directory\nOur Locations\nServices\nGrain\nAgronomy\nEnergy\nIuka Feeds\nSunflower Trading\nC-Stores\nFarm Supply Stores\nResources\nPatron Access\nKanza Connect\nKanza Club Card\nCareers\nCurrent Opportunities\nApply Now\nLinkedin\nInstagram\nFacebook\nContact Us\nWorking together for the love of the land.\nCASH BIDS\nFUTURES\nWEATHER\nNEWS\nDIRECTORY\nMaking it easy for you to do business\nOur job is to add value to the products we offer through outstanding service. We’re here for you when and where you need us.\nGrain\nPersonal attention. Efficient service. Competitive bids. We continually strive to make Kanza Cooperative your first choice when you’re ready to sell your crop.\nMore\nAgronomy\nGet the most from each input dollar. With competitive prices and unparalleled experience in local agronomy we deliver customized solutions to fit your farming operation.\nMore\nEnergy\nPartner with us for propane, superior Cenex fuels and lubricants, and a range of energy services and contracts. We’re here to help.\nMore\nIuka Feeds\nOur feed specialists work directly with you to develop and deliver customized feed for your animals, sourced from local ingredients.\nMore\nGet a Kanza Club Card\nApply for our loyalty charge card, which can be used for fuel and in-store\npurchases. When you use it, you’ll receive a fuel discount, and all purchases qualify for patronage in our cooperative. Also, as a member of our cooperative, you’ll share in our success!\nGet Started\nOrder Propane\nTo schedule propane service or delivery, please contact your preferred office:\nAndale Office at (316) 444-2141 Ext. 4\nIuka Office at 1-800-536-5614\nOr connect online:\nContact Us\nA specialized approach to feed.\nIuka Feeds is more than a feed mill. We’re feed specialists who work directly with you to provide a customized feed program for your specific operation. For more information contact us at 1-800-672-5508 or (620) 672-5508 .\nFeed Products\nAllstock\nCattle\nGamebird\nHorse\nOther\nPoultry\nSwine\nFeatured Products\nExplore Careers at Kanza Coop\nThere’s something special about a place where employees and customers work so well together and support each other. Whether you’re looking for a career opportunity or a part-time position, Kanza Cooperative strives to be the employer of choice in the communities we serve.\nCurrent Opportunities\n200 North Main\nIuka, KS 67066\nToll-free: (800) 536-5614\nABOUT\nWhat is a Coop?\nNews\nBoard of Directors\nEmployee Directory\nOur Locations\nSERVICES\nGrain\nAgronomy\nEnergy\nIuka Feeds\nSunflower Trading\nRESOURCES\nPatron Access\nKanza Connect\nKanza Club Card\nCAREERS\nOpenings\nApply Now\nPrivacy & Terms of Service\n|\nSite Map\n© 2026 Kanza Coop - All rights reserved\nSearch for:\nMinimum 3 character allowed.",
